msgstr "corptools - Corporation 审计"

#: checks.py:72
msgid "aa-structures"
msgstr "aa-structures"

#: checks.py:81
msgid "Audit missing"
msgstr "缺少审计"

#: checks.py:82
msgid "The character has no corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "该 Character 没有 corptools Character 审计。"

#: checks.py:83
msgid "The player adds this character in the corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "玩家在 corptools Character 审计中添加此 Character。"

#: checks.py:90
msgid "Scopes missing"
msgstr "缺少 Scope"

#: checks.py:91
msgid "None of the character's tokens carries all scopes corptools asks for."
msgstr "该 Character 的令牌中没有一个包含 corptools 所需的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:93
msgid ""
"The player adds this character in the corptools Character Audit again and "
"grants every scope it asks for."
msgstr "玩家在 corptools Character 审计中重新添加此 Character，并授予其要求的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:102
msgid "Audit inactive"
msgstr "审计未激活"

#: checks.py:103
msgid ""
"corptools marks the audit inactive: a section has not updated for too long."
msgstr "corptools 将该审计标记为未激活：某个部分太久没有更新。"

#: checks.py:104
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, the player adds "
"the character again."
msgstr "通常下一次 corptools 更新后即可恢复；如果仍然存在，玩家需重新添加该 Character。"

#: checks.py:111
msgid "Director token missing"
msgstr "缺少 Director 令牌"

#: checks.py:113
msgid ""
"The character is a Director of its Corporation, but none of its tokens "
"carries all scopes corptools needs for the Corporation audit."
msgstr ""
"该 Character 是其 Corporation 的 Director，但其令牌中没有一个包含 corptools 进行 Corporation "
"审计所需的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:116
msgid ""
"The Director adds a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "该 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中添加 Corporation 令牌。"

#: checks.py:123
msgid "Corporation audit missing"
msgstr "缺少 Corporation 审计"

#: checks.py:124
msgid "The Corporation has no corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "该 Corporation 没有 corptools Corporation 审计。"

#: checks.py:125
msgid "A Director adds the Corporation in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中添加该 Corporation。"

#: checks.py:132
msgid "Corporation token missing"
msgstr "缺少 Corporation 令牌"

#: checks.py:133
msgid ""
"No character of the Corporation has a token with the scopes the Corporation "
"audit needs."
msgstr "该 Corporation 没有任何 Character 拥有 Corporation 审计所需 Scope 的令牌。"

#: checks.py:134
msgid ""
"A Director adds a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中添加 Corporation 令牌。"

#: checks.py:141
msgid "Corporation data stale"
msgstr "Corporation 数据已过期"

#: checks.py:142
msgid "A section of the Corporation audit has not updated within the limit."
msgstr "Corporation 审计的某个部分未在期限内更新。"

#: checks.py:144
msgid ""
"A Director checks the Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit "
"and adds a new one if it lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中检查 Corporation 令牌，如其已失去角色则添加新令牌。"

#: checks.py:153
msgid "No structure owner"
msgstr "没有建筑所有者"

#: checks.py:154
msgid "The Corporation is not set up as an owner in aa-structures."
msgstr "该 Corporation 未在 aa-structures 中设置为所有者。"

#: checks.py:155
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds the Corporation as an owner "
"in aa-structures."
msgstr ""
"由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 aa-structures 中将该 Corporation 添加为所有者。"

#: checks.py:162
msgid "Structure owner inactive"
msgstr "建筑所有者未启用"

#: checks.py:163
msgid "The aa-structures owner of the Corporation is switched off."
msgstr "该 Corporation 的 aa-structures 所有者已被关闭。"

#: checks.py:164
msgid "An admin switches the owner on again in the aa-structures admin."
msgstr "由管理员在 aa-structures 管理后台重新启用该所有者。"

#: checks.py:170
msgid "No structure owner character"
msgstr "没有建筑所有者 Character"

#: checks.py:171
msgid ""
"The aa-structures owner has no enabled character left to fetch data with."
msgstr "该 aa-structures 所有者没有剩余的已启用 Character 可用于获取数据。"

#: checks.py:172
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds itself to the owner in aa-"
"structures."
msgstr "由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 aa-structures 中将自己添加到该所有者。"

#: checks.py:179
msgid "Structure sync failing"
msgstr "建筑同步失败"

#: checks.py:180
msgid "aa-structures reports a sync that is not up to date."
msgstr "aa-structures 报告有同步未保持最新。"

#: checks.py:181
msgid ""
"Check the owner in aa-structures: its characters may have lost the Station "
"Manager role."
msgstr "请在 aa-structures 中检查该所有者：其 Character 可能已失去 Station Manager 角色。"

