#: forms.py:15
msgid "Character Audit: sections that count"
msgstr "Character 审计：计入的部分"

#: forms.py:16
msgid ""
"A character is inactive when one of these has not updated within corptools' "
"limit."
msgstr "如果其中任何一项未在 corptools 的期限内更新，Character 即被视为未激活。"

#: forms.py:22
msgid "Character Audit: required scopes"
msgstr "Character 审计：所需 Scope"

#: forms.py:23
msgid "A character's token must carry all of these."
msgstr "Character 的令牌必须包含以下全部内容。"

#: forms.py:29
msgid "Corporation Audit: sections that count"
msgstr "Corporation 审计：计入的部分"

#: forms.py:30
msgid ""
"A Corporation's data is stale when one of these has not updated within the "
"limit above."
msgstr "如果其中任何一项未在上述期限内更新，Corporation 的数据即被视为已过期。"

#: forms.py:36
msgid "Corporation Audit: required scopes"
msgstr "Corporation 审计：所需 Scope"

#: forms.py:37
msgid "One token of a Corporation member must carry all of these."
msgstr "Corporation 成员的某一个令牌必须包含以下全部内容。"

