msgid "Stale after (days)"
msgstr "过期天数"

#: models.py:43
msgid ""
"Days after which a section of the corptools Corporation audit counts as "
"stale. Empty: the same limit corptools uses for characters."
msgstr ""
"corptools Corporation 审计的某个部分在多少天后被视为过期。留空：使用 corptools 对 Character 采用的同一期限。"

